    "detailed_description": "Let's go camping with K-BulMung.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhen we go camping in Korea, we play with fire.<br />\r\nThey think about many things and I also gain peace while playing with BulMung.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are two ways to enjoy K-BulMung.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you want to play the game quietly, you can enjoy K-BulMung alone, and if you want to play the game alone, you can enjoy K-BulMung with people all over the world through multi-game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAre you lonely because you are alone?<br />\r\nDon\u2019t you worry!<br />\r\nYou can go to K-BulMung by chatting with many people all over the world!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nK-BulMung simulation game with a comfortable atmosphere.<br />\r\nHave fun with K-BulMung Chat.",
